OL,3,AFight over fossil fuels leaves COP31
OL,4,Aclimate talks in deadlock
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second sticking point involves a push
OL,7,Ffrom the Africa Group to get
OL,8,Fcommitments on more money for
OL,9,Fadaptation - but the EU has previously
OL,10,Fsaid it would not support this.
OL,12,FNegotiating teams due to fly out on
OL,13,FSunday morning are now moving their
OL,14,Fflights to Monday in a sign that a deal
OL,15,Fis not yet in sight.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
